  splash layout rather than reusing the icon scale: Android 12 masks this
  drawable into a 72dp circle, so the mark is drawn at 0.87 scale to leave
  ~9dp of breathing room on every side. Max radius 26.95dp inside the 36dp
  splash mask. No wordmark, no animation, no artificial delay.
-->
